---
import Base from "../layouts/Base.astro";
---

<Base
  title="DMbot"
  description="DMbot listens to your table in Discord and quietly helps the game master. For 5e-compatible tabletop games."
>
  <section class="hero">
    <h1>Your table talks. DMbot listens and helps the game master (DM).</h1>
    <p class="lead muted">
      It writes down what was said, remembers the names your table makes up, and gives the game
      master quiet tips. It never makes up the story and never decides. Only players who say yes
      are recorded. For 5e-compatible tabletop games.
    </p>
    <a class="button" href="/install">Add DMbot to Discord</a>
    <p class="questions">
      <a href="/pricing#questions">Questions about plans and hours? Read the answers.</a>
    </p>
  </section>

  <section class="features" aria-label="What DMbot does">
    <article class="surface feature">
      <h2>Writes it down</h2>
      <p class="muted">
        Turns what was said at the table into text. Only players who said yes are recorded.
      </p>
    </article>
    <article class="surface feature">
      <h2>Remembers who's who</h2>
      <p class="muted">The people and places your table makes up, from one game to the next.</p>
    </article>
    <article class="surface feature">
      <h2>Quiet tips for the DM</h2>
      <p class="muted">
        Just for the game master, unless the DM lets players peek. DMbot never makes up the story or
        decides.
      </p>
    </article>
  </section>
  <p class="note muted">This page is being written. Check back soon.</p>
</Base>

<style>
  /* On a 360 x 640 phone the main button must show without scrolling (#559). */
  .hero {
    max-width: var(--text-width);
    padding-bottom: var(--space-8);
  }

  @media (min-width: 48rem) {
    .hero {
      padding-top: var(--space-8);
    }

    .lead {
      font-size: var(--text-lg);
    }
  }

  .questions {
    margin-top: var(--space-4);
  }

  .questions a {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    min-height: var(--tap);
  }

  .features {
    display: grid;
    gap: var(--space-4);
    margin-top: var(--space-4);
  }

  @media (min-width: 48rem) {
    .features {
      grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
    }
  }

  .feature {
    padding: var(--space-6);
  }

  .feature h2 {
    font-size: var(--text-lg);
    margin-bottom: var(--space-2);
  }

  .feature p {
    margin: 0;
  }

  .note {
    margin-top: var(--space-8);
    font-size: var(--text-sm);
  }
</style>
